{"unit_id": "tag:03PK:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由定理<REF_0001>、引理<REF_0002>及上同调（cohomology）的一般性质，对任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>和任意整数（integer）<MATH_0003>，我们得到长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence）<MATH_0001>。当然，句法平展（syntomic）上同调（cohomology）也有类似的序列（sequence）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0004>，并设<MATH_0005>是任意概形（scheme）。还有另一种更直接的方法，描述取值于<MATH_0006>的第一上同调（cohomology）群（group）。考虑二元组（pairs）<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>上的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0012>的<MATH_0011>次张量幂（tensor power）的平凡化（trivialization）。设<MATH_0013>是另一个这样的二元组（pair）。同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0014>是可逆（invertible）层（sheaves）的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0015>，使得图（diagram）<MATH_0016>交换（commutes）。于是我们有<MATHSEG_0001>若<MATHSEG_0002>它们不同构（isomorphic）<MATHSEG_0003>若<MATHSEG_0004>二元组（pairs）的同构（isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0005>此外，给定两个二元组（pairs）<MATH_0017>、<MATH_0018>，张量积（tensor product）<MATH_0019>也是一个二元组（pair）。二元组（pair）<MATH_0020>是此张量积（tensor product）运算的单位元（identity），其逆元（inverse）为<MATH_0021>。因此，二元组（pairs）的同构类（isomorphism classes）全体构成一个阿贝尔群（abelian group）。注意，<MATH_0022>是一个同构（isomorphism），因此这个群（group）的每个元素（element）的阶（order）都整除<MATH_0023>。我们提醒读者，这个群（group）一般<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>不是<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001><MATH_0024>-挠（torsion）的<MATH_0025>部分。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "long exact", "target_term": "长正合"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法平展"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "tensor power", "target_term": "张量幂"}, {"source_term": "trivialization", "target_term": "平凡化"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "单位元"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆元"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调", "context": "上同调及其序列。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定的概形。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "序列中的整数参数。"}, {"source_term": "long exact", "target_term": "长正合", "context": "上同调序列的正合性。"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "上同调序列。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法平展", "context": "句法平展上同调。"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群", "context": "上同调群及二元组的群。"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "带平凡化的可逆层二元组。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "tensor power", "target_term": "张量幂", "context": "可逆层的张量幂。"}, {"source_term": "trivialization", "target_term": "平凡化", "context": "张量幂的平凡化。"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "另一这样的二元组。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "二元组及可逆层的同构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "可逆层的同构。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "相容性图。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "图的交换性。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "二元组是否同构。"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积", "context": "二元组的张量积。"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "单位元", "context": "张量积运算的单位元。"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆元", "context": "该运算下的逆元。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类", "context": "二元组的同构类。"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "同构类构成的阿贝尔群。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "群的元素。"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶", "context": "元素的阶。"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠", "context": "Picard群的挠部分。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:040Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。有一个典范（canonical）等同（identification）<MATHSEG_0001>二元组（pairs）的群（group）<MATHSEG_0002>在上述同构（isomorphism）意义下<MATHSEG_0003>，条件是<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上可逆（invertible）。一般地，我们有<MATHSEG_0004>二元组（pairs）的群（group）<MATHSEG_0005>在上述同构（isomorphism）意义下<MATHSEG_0006>将fppf换成句法平展（syntomic）时，同一结果也成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法平展"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定概形。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "上同调与二元组群的典范等同。"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同", "context": "所述典范等同。"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "上述二元组。"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群", "context": "二元组同构类的群。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "按上述同构取类。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "参数在概形上可逆。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "句法平展", "context": "替换fppf。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04FM:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的一个几何点（geometric point）。考虑函子（functor）<MATHSEG_0001>使得<MATHSEG_0002>是<MATHSEG_0003>平展（tale）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATHSEG_0004>这里<MATH_0004>表示几何纤维（geometric fibre）的底层（underlying）集合（set）。则<MATH_0005>定义了景（site）<MATH_0007>的一个点（point）<MATH_0006>（《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>），且其关联的茎函子（stalk functor）<MATH_0008>（《景（Sites）》公式<REF_0002>）就是上面定义的函子（functor）<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "geometric point", "target_term": "几何点"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "geometric fibre", "target_term": "几何纤维"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "stalk functor", "target_term": "茎函子"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定的概形。"}, {"source_term": "geometric point", "target_term": "几何点", "context": "概形的几何点。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由所述条件定义的函子。"}, {"source_term": "tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "受保护前缀之后的平展邻域术语。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "几何点的平展邻域。"}, {"source_term": "geometric fibre", "target_term": "几何纤维", "context": "几何纤维的底层集合。"}, {"source_term": "underlying", "target_term": "底层", "context": "几何纤维的底层集合。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "纤维的底层集合。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "所定义点所属的景。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "景的点。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "stalk functor", "target_term": "茎函子", "context": "点所关联的茎函子。"}], "notes": []}
